  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasi omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 16:1)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi nigo arenge nemiaka emerongo ebere ekero achagete kogamba, na akagamba emiaka ikomi na etano nomo, agwo Yerusalemu. Takorete ayare amaronge ase amaiso ’Omonene buna Daudi, sokoro yaye, akorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabwatia chinchera chi’abarwoti b’Abaisraeli, naende akaroisia emegwekano ya Baali yanyititoire na kobombwa akayesasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agasamba ubani agwo ase Rikura ria mosinto o Hinomu. Naende agasamba abana baye bakaba ekeng’wanso, koreng’ana nogokora gw’okogechia okwo abanto banarete gokora, bari’Omonene aseretie korwa ase amasio ’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarua ebing’wanso na gosambera ubani agwo aase aimokererete igoro, na ase ebigoro, na inse ya kera omote omobese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esegi y’Abasiiria na Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Omonene, Nyasae oye, akabeeka Ahasi ase okoboko kw’omorwoti bw’Abasiiria. Barabwo bakamobua, bagoosa abanto abange, bakabaira Damesiki. Boig’Omonene akamobeka ase okoboko kw’omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli. Omorwoti oyio akamobua, agaita abanto abange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko erimo Peka, mosinto o Remalia, agaita abanto chituoni chilifu rigana erimo, na emerongo ebere (120,000) agwo ase ense ya Yuda. Aya nigo akoregete bo, ekiagera Abayuda batigete Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikiri, omonto etuoni korwa Efraimu, agaita Maaseya, omomura bw’omorwoti, na Asirikamu, omoteneneri bw’enyomba y’omorwoti, na Elikana, oyo o kabere ase omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bakabwata abanto bamwabo chilifu amagana abere (200,000): abakungu, na abana, abamura na abaiseke, bakabaira ase obosomba. Boigo bagasakora ebinto ebinge korwa ase abanto baria, bakabiira Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omobani Odedi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odedi, omobani bw’Omonene, nao arenge. Ere akagenda korotota abarwani b’esegi, baria bachete Samaria, akabateebia, “Rora Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiaino, nigo abeete nendamwamu ase Abayuda, akababeeka ase amaboko aino, korende inwe mwabaitire more nekeririanda, ekio kiamanyekanire igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bono nigo moganetie gokora Abayuda, na abanto ba Yerusalemu, abasacha na abakungu, babe abasomba baino. Inee! Inwe timori nebibe biaino abanyene mwakorire ase Omonene, Nyasae oino?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono inyigwere, irania abanto abwo mwosete korwa ase abanto bamino, ekiagera endamwamu entindi y’Omonene nigo ere igoro yaino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bande abanene b’Abaefraimu: Asaria, mosinto o Yohanani, na Berekia mosinto o Mesilemoti, na Yehisikia, mosinto o Salumu, na Amasa, mosinto o Hadilai, bagatenena gokania abarwani baria barenge koirana korwa ase esegi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakabateebia, “Timobaisa korenta aa abanto abwo mwosete; moise gokora bo, nigo morabaise kogera tobe nokomocha ase Omonene komenta amo nebibe na okomocha tore nakwo bono. Okomocha tobwate nigo kore okonene, na endamwamu entindi ya Nyasae nigo ere igoro ase Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio abasikari bagatiga abanto baria boosete amo nebisakorwa ase amasio ’abanene baria na ase omosangererekano bwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto amarieta abo atoretwe bakaimoka, bakaboyia baria boosetwe barenge gesobono, bakababeekera chianga na ebikoroto, bakabaa nendagera na ebinyugwa, bakabaaka namaguta. Naende bakariinia ase chitigere baria batarenge ne chinguru, bakaira baria bonsi boosetwe, amo nebisakorwa bionsi gochia Yeriko, Omochie bw’Emekendo, ase abamwabo bamenyete. Magega y’ayio bakairana Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasi okoboria Abaasuri bamokonye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Abar 16:7)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eria Ahasi omorwoti agatoma amang’ana ase omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, akamobooria amokonye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaedomu konya barwanirie Abayuda baababuire na boosire abanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Abafirisiti konya baumokeire emechie y’ense omweya ya Yuda amo na Negebu, bakaira Beti‐Semesi, na Ayaloni, na Gederoti, na Soko, amo nebichie biaye, na Timuna amo nebichie biaye, na Gimoso amo nebichie biaye, bakamenya aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nigo aganetie kwororoberia Abayuda ase engencho y’Ahasi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, ekiagera ere arenterete Abayuda obosooku na tarenge omwegenwa ase Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Tiligati‐Pileseri, omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, akagenda akamorwania na komochanda ribaga ri’okomokonya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi akaurereria enyomba y’Omonene, na enyomba y’omorwoti, na ey’abanene barenge nere, akaa omorwoti bw’Abaasuri ebango, korende ayio tamokonyete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebibe bi’Ahasi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi omorwoti oria oria akamenta gotaba omwegenwa ase Omonene, ase engaki eria anyorete emechando.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarua ebing’wanso ase chinyasae chia Damesiki, chiria konya chiamobuire, agateeba, “Chinyasae chi’abarwoti b’Abasiiria nachio chiabakonyete bakabua, goika nchiruere ebing’wanso, erinde chinkonye nainche.” Korende chirochio chikarenta ogosirigwa kwaye na okw’Abaisraeli bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi agasangereria ebikorero bi’enyomba ya Nyasae, akabinachana ebing’ese, erio agasieka ebisieri bi’enyomba y’Omonene, akayeroiseria ebisasimero aase ande onsi agwo Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase kera omochie bw’Abayuda akaroisia aase aimokererete igoro ogosambera ubani ase chinyasae ching’ao; Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiaye, akagechigwa goika akaba nendamwamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi Ahasi akorete, ne chinchera chiaye chionsi, korwa omochakano goika omoerio, nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abayuda na ab’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi akarara ase chisokoro chiaye chiaraarete, na abanto bakamotindeka ase omochie o Yerusalemu; tibamobegete ase chimbeera ase abarwoti b’Abaisraeli baare gotindekwa. Hezekia, omomura oye, akaba okogamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
